msgstr "Di <code>claude.ai</code>, buka <code>Customize → Connectors</code>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:674
msgid ""
"Click <strong>+ Add</strong>, then <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Klik <strong>+ Add</strong>, lalu <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:678
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link above, click <strong>Continue</strong> and then "
"<strong>Add</strong>. If Claude asks which OAuth client to use, choose "
"<strong>Register automatically</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Beri nama, tempel tautan di atas, klik <strong>Continue</strong> lalu "
"<strong>Add</strong>. Jika Claude bertanya klien OAuth mana yang dipakai, "
"pilih <strong>Register automatically</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:679
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link from step 1, click <strong>Continue</strong> and "
"then <strong>Add</strong>. If Claude asks which OAuth client to use, choose "
"<strong>Register automatically</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Beri nama, tempel tautan dari langkah 1, klik <strong>Continue</strong> lalu "
"<strong>Add</strong>. Jika Claude bertanya klien OAuth mana yang dipakai, "
"pilih <strong>Register automatically</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:736
msgid ""
"This site runs on your computer, so the cloud connector cannot reach it. "
"Claude Desktop connects through a <strong>local bridge</strong> instead: the "
"open-source <code>mcp-remote</code> package, started with <code>npx</code> "
"(needs Node.js). It signs in in your browser, and nothing is exposed to the "
"internet."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini berjalan di komputer Anda, sehingga konektor cloud tidak dapat "
"menjangkaunya. Claude Desktop terhubung lewat <strong>jembatan lokal</"
"strong>: paket sumber terbuka <code>mcp-remote</code>, dijalankan dengan "
"<code>npx</code> (perlu Node.js). Masuk dilakukan di peramban Anda, dan "
"tidak ada yang terekspos ke internet."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:738
msgid "Add the bridge to Claude Desktop"
msgstr "Tambahkan jembatan ke Claude Desktop"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:739
msgid ""
"Run this in Terminal (macOS) or PowerShell (Windows), then fully quit and "
"reopen the Claude app."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan ini di Terminal (macOS) atau PowerShell (Windows), lalu tutup "
"sepenuhnya aplikasi Claude dan buka kembali."

