msgstr "Lalu jalankan ini sebagai gantinya, dengan kunci di header:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:765
msgid ""
"The key is stored in plain text in that file, so prefer a <strong>read-only</"
"strong> key unless this connection needs to make changes, and revoke it here "
"when you no longer use it."
msgstr ""
"Kunci disimpan sebagai teks biasa di berkas itu, jadi utamakan kunci "
"<strong>hanya-baca</strong> kecuali koneksi ini perlu membuat perubahan, dan "
"cabut di sini saat tidak lagi dipakai."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:776
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:984
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1245
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa apakah berhasil"

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:779
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open a new chat in Claude Desktop and click the tools icon — <code>%s</code> "
"should be listed. The first start takes a moment while the bridge downloads."
msgstr ""
"Buka obrolan baru di Claude Desktop dan klik ikon alat — <code>%s</code> "
"seharusnya muncul di daftar. Mulai pertama butuh beberapa saat selagi "
"jembatan diunduh."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:819
msgid "Getting a certificate error?"
msgstr "Mendapat galat sertifikat?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:821
msgid ""
"Local sites usually use a self-signed certificate that AI tools reject. "
"Since this site runs on this computer, use the plain <code>http://</code> "
"address instead: the connection never leaves your machine. Avoid the "
"<code>NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0</code> workaround: it disables "
"certificate checks for everything that tool connects to."
msgstr ""
"Situs lokal biasanya memakai sertifikat self-signed yang ditolak alat AI. "
"Karena situs ini berjalan di komputer ini, gunakan alamat <code>http://</"
"code> biasa: koneksi tidak pernah keluar dari mesin Anda. Hindari trik "
"<code>NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0</code>: ia mematikan pemeriksaan "
"sertifikat untuk semua yang dihubungi alat itu."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:851
msgid ""
"Run these in your terminal. The second line opens your browser to sign in."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan perintah berikut di terminal Anda. Baris kedua membuka browser Anda "
"untuk masuk."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:852
msgid "Run this in your terminal. Codex opens your browser to sign in."
msgstr "Jalankan ini di terminal Anda. Codex membuka browser Anda untuk masuk."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name used in the command
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:854
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Run this in your terminal, then start <code>gemini</code>: it opens your "
"browser to sign in (if it does not, run <code>/mcp auth %s</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan ini di terminal Anda, lalu jalankan <code>gemini</code>: ia membuka "
"peramban Anda untuk masuk (jika tidak, jalankan <code>/mcp auth %s</code>)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:855
msgid ""
"Run this in your terminal. Opencode opens your browser to sign in the first "
"time it connects."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan ini di terminal Anda. Opencode membuka peramban Anda untuk masuk "
"saat pertama kali terhubung."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:856
msgid ""
"Start <code>muse</code> and paste this message. Muse adds the server to its "
"settings; approve the change when it asks."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan <code>muse</code> lalu tempel pesan ini. Muse menambahkan server ke "
"pengaturannya; setujui perubahannya saat diminta."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:860
msgid "Add the server"
msgstr "Tambahkan server"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:871
msgid "Then quit Muse and run this. It opens your browser to sign in:"
msgstr ""
"Lalu keluar dari Muse dan jalankan ini. Browser Anda akan terbuka untuk "
"masuk:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:877
msgid ""
"Over SSH? Add <code>--no-browser</code> to the second line and open the "
"printed URL in a local browser."
msgstr ""
"Lewat SSH? Tambahkan <code>--no-browser</code> ke baris kedua dan buka URL "
"yang dicetak di peramban lokal."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:879
msgid ""
"Over SSH? Add <code>--headless</code> and paste back the address your "
"browser ends on."
msgstr ""
"Lewat SSH? Tambahkan <code>--headless</code> lalu tempel kembali alamat "
"tempat browser Anda berhenti."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:882
msgid ""
"Local https sites usually use a self-signed certificate that these tools "
"reject: trust it in your tool, or set the WordPress Site Address to the "
"<code>http://</code> URL."
msgstr ""
"Situs https lokal biasanya memakai sertifikat self-signed yang ditolak alat-"
"alat ini: percayai sertifikat itu di alat Anda, atau atur Alamat Situs "
"WordPress ke URL <code>http://</code>."

#. translators: 1: config file path, 2: the MCP server name used in the command
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:887
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this to <code>%1$s</code> (merge it if the file exists), then run "
"<code>muse mcp login %2$s</code>."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan ini ke <code>%1$s</code> (gabungkan jika berkasnya sudah ada), "
"lalu jalankan <code>muse mcp login %2$s</code>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:904
msgid "Add to Cursor"
msgstr "Tambahkan ke Cursor"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:904
msgid "Install in VS Code"
msgstr "Pasang di VS Code"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:906
msgid "Accept in Cursor. It opens your browser to sign in."
msgstr "Terima di Cursor. Peramban Anda terbuka untuk masuk."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:907
msgid ""
"Confirm in VS Code and trust the server. It opens your browser to sign in."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi di VS Code dan percayai servernya. Peramban Anda terbuka untuk "
"masuk."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:918
msgid "Use a command instead"
msgstr "Gunakan perintah saja"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:920
msgid ""
"Run this in your terminal (the <code>code</code> command ships with VS "
"Code), then open Copilot Chat. It signs in on first use."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan ini di terminal Anda (perintah <code>code</code> disertakan bersama "
"VS Code), lalu buka Copilot Chat. Aplikasi masuk saat pertama kali digunakan."

#. translators: %s: path of the client's config file.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:927
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this to <code>%s</code>, then restart Cursor. It signs in on first use."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan ini ke <code>%s</code>, lalu mulai ulang Cursor. Masuk dilakukan "
"saat pertama dipakai."

#. translators: %s: config file path
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:945
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Add this to <code>%s</code>, then restart the app. It signs in on first use."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan ini ke <code>%s</code>, lalu mulai ulang aplikasinya. Masuk "
"dilakukan saat pertama dipakai."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:963
msgid ""
"n8n cloud connects from n8n's servers and cannot reach a local site; a self-"
"hosted n8n on this machine works."
msgstr ""
"n8n cloud terhubung dari server n8n dan tidak dapat menjangkau situs lokal; "
"n8n yang di-host sendiri di mesin ini berfungsi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:965
msgid "Add an MCP Client Tool node"
msgstr "Tambahkan node MCP Client Tool"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:966
msgid ""
"In your workflow, add the <strong>MCP Client Tool</strong> node to your "
"agent and fill in:"
msgstr ""
"Di workflow Anda, tambahkan node <strong>MCP Client Tool</strong> ke agen "
"Anda dan isi:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:968
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:976
msgid "Copy endpoint URL"
msgstr "Salin URL endpoint"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:968
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:976
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "Endpoint"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:969
msgid "Server Transport"
msgstr "Server Transport"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:970
msgid ""
"<strong>Bearer Auth</strong> — create a Bearer Auth credential and paste the "
"API key below."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bearer Auth</strong> — buat kredensial Bearer Auth dan tempel kunci "
"API di bawah."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:970
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Authentication"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:973
msgid "Prefer OAuth2?"
msgstr "Lebih suka OAuth2?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:975
msgid ""
"Set Authentication to <strong>OAuth2</strong> and create a new OAuth2 "
"credential: n8n registers itself with this site and opens the sign-in when "
"you connect. Click Copy on the endpoint above first — it turns on new "
"connections for 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Atur Authentication ke <strong>OAuth2</strong> dan buat kredensial OAuth2 "
"baru: n8n mendaftarkan dirinya ke situs ini dan membuka proses masuk saat "
"Anda terhubung. Klik Salin pada endpoint di atas terlebih dahulu — ini "
"mengaktifkan koneksi baru selama 30 menit."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:977
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:997
msgid ""
"A sign-in page opens on <strong>your site</strong>. Pick the access level "
"and click <strong>Approve</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Halaman masuk terbuka di <strong>situs Anda</strong>. Pilih tingkat akses "
"dan klik <strong>Approve</strong>."

#. translators: %s: URL of the Settings tab
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:980
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Self-hosted n8n: add your n8n host under <a href=\"%s\">Settings → "
"Additional allowed hosts</a> first. n8n cloud is already allowed."
msgstr ""
"n8n yang di-host sendiri: tambahkan host n8n Anda terlebih dahulu di <a "
"href=\"%s\">Pengaturan → Host tambahan yang diizinkan</a>. n8n cloud sudah "
"diizinkan."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:985
msgid ""
"Execute the node once — its Tools output lists <code>cowboy_discover</code> "
"and <code>cowboy_run</code>."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan node sekali — keluaran Tools-nya menampilkan <code>cowboy_discover</"
"code> dan <code>cowboy_run</code>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1023
msgid "Then add the server with the key in a header:"
msgstr "Lalu tambahkan server dengan kunci di header:"

